From: VAP scale optimization series
Subject: [PATCH 0010] cel: lazify per-compiler varEnvs and share request/namespace DeclTypes

The per-compiler varEnvs map was constructed eagerly via mustBuildEnvs,
which builds the full Cartesian product of OptionalVariableDeclarations
combinations (HasParams x HasAuthorizer x HasPatchTypes = 8 entries).
VAP only ever asks for 2 of those 8 combinations and MAP for 4, so 4-6
of every compiler's slots were dead weight from the moment of
construction.

This patch replaces the 8-entry map with:

  * a sync.Map + sync.Once-per-key lazy builder, so envs are only
    materialised on the first CompileCELExpression call that actually
    needs them
  * package-level singletons for cachedNamespaceType / cachedRequestType
    so the static type definitions returned by BuildNamespaceType /
    BuildRequestType are not rebuilt once per compiler

The fix is a self-contained refactor of compile.go (newCachedCompiler
construction is unchanged externally; consumers of the previous
varEnvs map[OptionalVariableDeclarations]*EnvSet shape are updated to
call varEnvs.get(opts)).

Empirical impact on a synthetic load of 5000 empty VAPs (one
compilePolicy() per policy, all retained in a slice):

                       before        after        delta
  per-policy retained  56.4 KiB      42.6 KiB     -24.5%
  bytes/op (compile)   784 KiB       55 KiB       -93.0%
  allocs/op (compile)  6904          349          -94.9%
  ns/op (compile)      1.45 ms       0.094 ms     -93.5%

The retained-heap drop is the conservative figure; most of the
eliminated work was transient. The big production win is the ~14x
cut in compile-time allocation, which is paid on every refreshPolicies
tick and every policy spec change.

The benchmark and methodology used to capture these numbers are
included as per_policy_overhead_bench_test.go. See ../README.md for
how to run it.

Tested:
  go test ./staging/src/k8s.io/apiserver/pkg/admission/plugin/cel/...           PASS
  go test ./staging/src/k8s.io/apiserver/pkg/admission/plugin/policy/...        PASS
  go test ./staging/src/k8s.io/apiserver/pkg/cel/...                            PASS

